OL,3,GNEWSASchool closes after powerbank in
OL,4,Abag causes fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA secondary school was closed following
OL,7,Fa fire believed to have been caused by
OL,8,Fa powerbank in a student's bag which
OL,9,Fdamaged part of the building.
OL,11,FIn a social media post, Scott Barlow,
OL,12,Fthe headteacher of Sir William
OL,13,FRobertson Academy in Welbourn,
OL,14,FLincolnshire said the blaze was put out
OL,15,Fby a teacher and nobody was injured in
OL,16,Fthe incident on Monday.
OL,18,FFollowing an investigation by
OL,19,FLincolnshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,20,Fthe school has banned pupils bringing
OL,21,Fportable charging banks or aerosols
OL,22,Finto the school.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
